  "sourceTitle": "Splendid Salad Dressing",
  "sourceText": "Splendid Salad Dressing\nBy: Emily Heston\nPublished: Tuesday, December 8, 2009 - 11:32pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup olive oil\n1/4 cup tarragon vinegar\n1 tablespoon Dijon Vinegar\n2 cloves of garlic, pressed or finely minced\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add ingredients to a screw top jar and shake until fully emulsified.\n\nAbout\n\n\nDelicious on salads, sandwiches, or as a vegetable dip.",
